.         * we want to generate RFs for both with ref temperature at 27, and ref temp at the median of data
.                 foreach LL in $LL_list {c -(}                
{txt} 20{com}.                         foreach ref_temp in `center' `default_ref_temp' {c -(}
{txt} 21{com}.                                 clear 
